### Create Booking (Missing Token) (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hid": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-06-15",
  "endDate": "2026-06-20"
}

### Create Booking (Overlapping Date) (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hid": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-06-05",
  "endDate": "2026-06-12"
}

### Create Booking (Invalid Dates) (Start after End) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hid": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-07-20",
  "endDate": "2026-07-10"
}



### Get Booking by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}

### Get Booking by ID (Missing Token) (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/1

### Get Booking (Non-existent ID) (Should return 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/999
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}

### Get Booking (Invalid ID format) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}

### List Bookings by hid
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings?hid=1
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}

### List Bookings by hid (Missing Token) (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings?hid=1

### List Bookings by hid with Date Filters and Pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings?hid=1&startDate=2026-05-01&endDate=2026-07-01&skip=0&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}

### List Bookings (Missing mandatory hid) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}

### Get Available Houses (Success)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/available?startDate=2026-06-01&endDate=2026-06-10&skip=0&limit=10

### Get Available Houses (Missing Mandatory Dates) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/available?startDate=2026-06-01

### Get Available Houses (Invalid Date Format) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/available?startDate=not-a-date&endDate=2026-06-15

### Get Available Houses (Start after End) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/available?startDate=2026-06-20&endDate=2026-06-10

### Get Available Days in Month (Success)
GET http://localhost:8080/houses/1/availability?month=2026-06

### Get Available Days in Month (Missing month) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/houses/1/availability

### Get Available Days in Month (Invalid month format) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/houses/1/availability?month=06-2026

### Get Available Days in Month (Invalid house id) (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/houses/abc/availability?month=2026-06